           05  OUT-EQUIP-NUM   PIC X(06).
           05  OUT-WO-NUM      PIC X(10).
           05  OUT-JOBPLAN     PIC X(10).
           05  OUT-LEVEL       PIC X(02).
           05  OUT-PRIORITY    PIC X(02).
           05  OUT-PRE-REL     PIC X(10).
           05  OUT-CL          PIC X(03).

       FD  PRINT-FILE RECORD   CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
