       01  SCH-ALL.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM4401.

       FD  PM-SIMULATOR-WO
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
       01  SIM-WO-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM4504.

       FD  PM-SIMULATOR-EQP
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
       01  SIM-EQP-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM4503.

       FD  PM-SIMULATOR-ZN
           LABEL RECORDS       ARE STANDARD.
